 The former adapter copies 3072 blocks of256 bytes through fixture reads and byte-wide full_write. Its HLS copy+write estimate alone is approximately9.44M cycles, not measured runtime. The new adapter accepts the same complete physical QKV image from a real external test producer. It tests production owner import/publication and the original LOAD_KV→QK→SCORE/PROB lease→Softmax→AV→ATT_OUT chain. It does not execute upstream Q8 projection or the old RTL full_write fixture producer. No production numeric implementation, owner helper, memory layout or error path is copied/reimplemented or modified.
 
